      "content": "therapy wont change the fact that the world is just built to reject me though. it feels like i'm just trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken. i look at people who just... exist without all this noise, and i'm just so jealous. it feels like there's no real version of my life where i actually get to be happy and safe. it's just a constant cycle of damage.",
